   {"mm": [30.2, 411.1, 147.2, 416.6], "text": "WARD-BECK SYSTEMS LTD."},
   {"mm": [150.7, 362.7, 194.3, 369.4], "text": "DESCR PTION"},
   {"mm": [126.1, 349.3, 218.5, 356.0], "text": "8-109 AMPLIFI ER SERIES"},
   {"mm": [44.5, 323.0, 112.3, 329.9], "text": "Output Impedance:"},
   {"mm": [134.3, 323.0, 209.2, 329.9], "text": "Less than 100 ohms."},
   {"mm": [44.7, 309.6, 103.8, 316.3], "text": "Load Impedance:"},
   {"mm": [134.1, 309.6, 209.6, 316.3], "text": "600 ohms, balanced."},
   {"mm": [44.3, 296.2, 95.6, 303.2], "text": "Output Level:"},
   {"mm": [133.9, 296.2, 198.2, 303.2], "text": "+30 dBm ma ximum."},
   {"mm": [44.5, 282.4, 120.3, 289.1], "text": "Power Requirements:"},
   {"mm": [133.9, 282.4, 294.3, 289.1], "text": "t21.S \"volts dc, 18 mA quiescent current,"},
   {"mm": [134.1, 275.5, 226.3, 282.4], "text": "6S mA at +30 dBm output"},
   {"mm": [44.3, 262.5, 71.9, 269.3], "text": "Ambient"},
   {"mm": [76.6, 262.5, 120.5, 269.5], "text": "Temperature"},
   {"mm": [142.3, 262.5, 229.5, 269.5], "text": "to 60 degrees Celsius."},
   {"mm": [44.5, 249.1, 87.2, 255.9], "text": "Dimensions:"},
   {"mm": [134.1, 249.1, 152.6, 255.9], "text": "3.2S\""},
   {"mm": [166.5, 249.1, 185.9, 255.9], "text": "3.38\""},
   {"mm": [198.6, 249.1, 217.2, 255.9], "text": "0.S7\""},
   {"mm": [134.3, 242.0, 157.4, 248.7], "text": "(83 mm"},
   {"mm": [170.3, 242.0, 190.0, 248.7], "text": "86 mm"},
   {"mm": [203.2, 242.0, 229.1, 248.7], "text": "IS mm)."},
   {"mm": [44.0, 221.9, 290.4, 228.7], "text": "The 8-109 comprises two amplifier sections, one consisting of"},
   {"mm": [44.3, 215.3, 294.1, 222.0], "text": "ZI with QI through Q4, and the other of Z2 with QS through Q8."},
   {"mm": [43.8, 201.9, 220.6, 208.6], "text": "The linear integrated circuit ZI operates as"},
   {"mm": [234.7, 201.9, 297.9, 208.6], "text": "preamplifier and"},
   {"mm": [44.3, 195.0, 236.8, 201.9], "text": "buffer stage to drive the transistor output ampl"},
   {"mm": [262.8, 195.0, 293.2, 201.9], "text": "section."},
   {"mm": [44.5, 181.8, 278.5, 188.5], "text": "In the ma jority of the 8-109 models, the inputs of he two"},
   {"mm": [44.0, 174.9, 204.5, 181.8], "text": "amplifier sections are interconnected as"},
   {"mm": [218.5, 174.9, 269.9, 181.8], "text": "cross coupled"},
   {"mm": [44.0, 168.2, 157.0, 174.9], "text": "differential pair to provide"},
   {"mm": [170.1, 168.2, 285.2, 174.9], "text": "balanced input. Alternately,"},
   {"mm": [56.6, 161.5, 116.2, 168.4], "text": "the case of the"},
   {"mm": [129.5, 161.5, 160.4, 168.4], "text": "109A and"},
   {"mm": [186.1, 161.5, 282.0, 168.4], "text": "single-ended, unbalanced"},
   {"mm": [44.5, 155.4, 99.1, 162.2], "text": "input is used."},
   {"mm": [43.8, 141.4, 265.6, 148.4], "text": "The balanced input yields several input characteristics"},
   {"mm": [44.0, 134.7, 297.5, 141.4], "text": "similar to those of an input transformer. Output level remains"},
   {"mm": [43.8, 127.8, 213.3, 134.5], "text": "constant when the input is fed from either"},
   {"mm": [226.3, 127.8, 281.5, 134.5], "text": "balanced or an"},
   {"mm": [44.0, 121.3, 273.8, 128.3], "text": "unbalanced source. Good common mode rejection is another"},
   {"mm": [44.0, 114.6, 220.4, 121.6], "text": "feature of this type of input configuration."},
   {"mm": [44.3, 101.3, 298.4, 108.0], "text": "For ampli fiers operating in the balanced mode, the value of RIS"},
   {"mm": [43.4, 94.6, 285.2, 101.3], "text": "establishes the feedback ratio of he two amplifier sections"},
   {"mm": [43.6, 87.9, 191.9, 94.6], "text": "and thus controls the amplifier gain."},
   {"mm": [43.6, 74.3, 301.8, 81.0], "text": "When utilized in the unbalanced arrangement the lower amplifier"},
   {"mm": [43.6, 67.4, 168.8, 74.3], "text": "section (Z2 with QS th rough Q8)"},
   {"mm": [185.7, 67.4, 288.9, 74.3], "text": "used as the input section,"},
   {"mm": [43.4, 60.7, 280.9, 67.4], "text": "with the input signal applied to pin E2. Amplifier gain is"},
   {"mm": [284.8, 59.2, 305.7, 68.3], "text": "ps"},
   {"mm": [43.6, 47.7, 295.1, 60.9], "text": "determined by the values of R6 and RII. One half of the BS"},
   {"mm": [43.8, 47.1, 285.4, 53.8], "text": "balanced output signal appears at pin E6. The upper half of"},
   {"mm": [44.0, 40.4, 240.1, 47.1], "text": "the amplifier (ZI with QI through Q4) operates as"},
   {"mm": [254.3, 40.4, 293.0, 47.1], "text": "unity gain"},
   {"mm": [250.9, 25.3, 269.4, 32.5], "text": "tp"},
   {"mm": [243.5, 18.1, 264.5, 25.3], "text": "ht"},
   {"mm": [153.1, 5.4, 188.5, 12.1], "text": "8-109-1-2"}
  ]
 },
